      "writtenOn": "2015-08-19T01:05:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I reread your comment. Skylake is not out of deep sleep until RSMRST_L deasserts. The fact that we\u0027re holding the primary rails off means RSMRST_L will not deassert so skylake hasn\u0027t left deep sleep yet -- only has requested it.",
      "parentUuid": "c4156984_ceb677c0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
